WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.900
Does your team still deal with IT
one problem at a time?

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.300
For a growing business
with 10 to 100 users,

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:11.300
that gets expensive quickly
in downtime,

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:15.600
security risk, and time your people
should be spending on customers.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:20.300
I'm Kyle Hearn, founder of
TechSavvy Consulting in Tulsa.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:25.100
I've supported business technology
in Tulsa since 1998,

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:30.250
and our goal is simple: make IT
one less thing you have to manage.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:34.200
Through a predictable monthly
managed services relationship,

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.480
we support your people
and your technology,

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.560
from computers, servers, and networks

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:44.600
to Microsoft 365, cloud systems,

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:48.850
backups, security planning,
and vendor coordination.

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:52.550
But managed IT is more
than fixing problems.

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:56.400
We learn how your business works,
plan ahead,

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:59.980
communicate clearly,
and give you honest recommendations

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:02.950
without unnecessary complexity.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:07.150
If your company has roughly
10 to 100 users,

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:12.150
TechSavvy may be the right
long-term IT partner for you.

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.350
Book a discovery call below.

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.850
We'll talk about what is working,

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.400
where technology is slowing you down,

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.100
and the safest next step.
